any idea what that means?

00:24:40.200 --> 00:24:42.200
'Cause Max was like, he said, okay.

00:24:42.200 --> 00:24:44.120
She said, that means dad's
gonna be following us,

00:24:44.120 --> 00:24:45.340
following all of our posts.

00:24:45.340 --> 00:24:47.060
We won't be able to say this,
that and the other thing.

00:24:47.060 --> 00:24:48.890
So, I have it today

00:24:48.890 --> 00:24:51.710
